  "blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "text": "There was a table set out under a tree in front of the house, and the March Hare and the Hatter were having tea at it: a Dormouse was sitting between them, fast asleep, and the other two were using it as a cushion, resting their elbows on it, and talking over its head.",
          "gap": " ",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 14281,
          "voice": "F2"
        },
        {
          "text": "“Very uncomfortable for the Dormouse,”",
          "gap": " ",
          "start": 14711,
          "end": 16640,
          "voice": "F5",
          "dialogue": true,
          "speaker": "Alice"
        },
        {
          "text": "thought Alice;",
          "gap": " ",
          "start": 16900,
          "end": 17607,
          "voice": "F2"
        },
        {
          "text": "“only, as it’s asleep, I suppose it doesn’t mind.”",
          "gap": "",
          "start": 17857,
          "end": 20443,
          "voice": "F5",
          "dialogue": true,
          "speaker": "Alice"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "text": "The table was a large one, but the three were all crowded together at one corner of it:",
          "gap": " ",
          "start": 21243,
          "end": 25357,
          "voice": "F2"
        },
        {
          "text": "“No room!",
          "gap": " ",
          "start": 25607,
          "end": 26042,
          "voice": "M2",
          "dialogue": true
        },
        {
          "text": "No room!”",
          "gap": " ",
          "start": 26512,
          "end": 27063,
          "voice": "M2",
          "dialogue": true
        },
        {
          "text": "they cried out when they saw Alice coming.",
          "gap": " ",
          "start": 27373,
          "end": 28922,
          "voice": "F2"
        },
        {
          "text": "“There’s plenty of room!”",
          "gap": " ",
          "start": 29802,
          "end": 30974,
          "voice": "F5",
          "dialogue": true,
          "speaker": "Alice"
        },
        {
          "text": "said Alice indignantly, and she sat down in a large arm-chair at one end of the table.",
          "gap": "",
          "start": 31264,
          "end": 35945,
          "voice": "F2"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "text": "“Have some wine,”",
          "gap": " ",
          "start": 36655,
          "end": 37451,
          "voice": "M2",
          "dialogue": true,
          "speaker": "March Hare"
        },
        {
          "text": "the March Hare said in an encouraging tone.",
          "gap": "",
          "start": 37681,
          "end": 39475,
          "voice": "F2"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "text": "Alice looked all round the table, but there was nothing on it but tea.",
          "gap": " ",
          "start": 40175,
          "end": 43382,
          "voice": "F2"
        },
        {
          "text": "“I don’t see any wine,”",
          "gap": " ",
          "start": 43802,
          "end": 44940,
          "voice": "F5",
          "dialogue": true,
          "speaker": "Alice"
        },
        {
          "text": "she remarked.",
          "gap": "",
          "start": 45200,
          "end": 45756,
          "voice": "F2"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "text": "“There isn’t any,”",
          "gap": " ",
          "start": 46036,
          "end": 46802,
          "voice": "M2",
          "dialogue": true,
          "speaker": "March Hare"
        },
        {
          "text": "said the March Hare.",
          "gap": "",
          "start": 47072,
          "end": 48009,
          "voice": "F2"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "text": "“Then it wasn’t very civil of you to offer it,”",
          "gap": " ",
          "start": 48209,
          "end": 50374,
          "voice": "F5",
          "dialogue": true,
          "speaker": "Alice"
        },
        {
          "text": "said Alice angrily.",
          "gap": "",
          "start": 50624,
          "end": 51631,
          "voice": "F2"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "text": "“It wasn’t very civil of you to sit down without being invited,”",
          "gap": " ",
          "start": 52551,
          "end": 55703,
          "voice": "M2",
          "dialogue": true,
          "speaker": "March Hare"
        },
        {
          "text": "said the March Hare.",
          "gap": "",
          "start": 55973,
          "end": 56910,
          "voice": "F2"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "text": "“I didn’t know it was your table,”",
          "gap": " ",
          "start": 57340,
          "end": 58863,
          "voice": "F5",
          "dialogue": true,
          "speaker": "Alice"
        },
        {
          "text": "said Alice;",
          "gap": " ",
          "start": 59133,
          "end": 59804,
          "voice": "F2"
        },
        {
          "text": "“it’s laid for a great many more than three.”",
          "gap": "",
          "start": 60074,
          "end": 62089,
          "voice": "F5",
          "dialogue": true,
          "speaker": "Alice"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "text": "“Your hair wants cutting,”",
          "gap": " ",
          "start": 62329,
          "end": 63406,
          "voice": "M3",
          "dialogue": true,
          "speaker": "Hatter"
        },
        {
          "text": "said the Hatter.",
          "gap": " ",
          "start": 63636,
          "end": 64347,
          "voice": "F2"
        },
        {
          "text": "He had been looking at Alice for some time with great curiosity, and this was his first speech.",
          "gap": "",
          "start": 64697,
          "end": 69533,
          "voice": "F2"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "text": "“You should learn not to make personal remarks,”",
          "gap": " ",
          "start": 70273,
          "end": 72573,
          "voice": "F5",
          "dialogue": true,
          "speaker": "Alice"
        },
        {
          "text": "Alice said with some severity;",
          "gap": " ",
          "start": 72843,
          "end": 74196,
          "voice": "F2"
        },
        {
          "text": "“it’s very rude.”",
          "gap": "",
          "start": 74446,
          "end": 75413,
          "voice": "F5",
          "dialogue": true,
          "speaker": "Alice"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
